RGB Badge

This project is an original hardware, firmware and mechanical design inspired by
the FOSSASIA Badge Magic Hardware Board:

    https://github.com/fossasia/badgemagic-hardware

The FOSSASIA repository is used as an attributed reference for its wearable
badge concept, approximate form factor and pixel pitch. No FOSSASIA PCB layout
or design-source file has been copied into this repository.

At the time this notice was created, the referenced FOSSASIA repository stated
that its hardware sources were available under the Apache License 2.0. Any
third-party material added later must retain its own copyright, attribution and
licensing notices.

The project-local `ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U` footprint adapts pad geometry from
Espressif's `espressif/kicad-libraries` release 3.2.1. That upstream library is
CC-BY-SA-4.0 with the KiCad schematic-design exception reproduced in
`LICENSES/Espressif-KiCad-CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt`. The footprint description also
records this provenance. No upstream 3D model is included.
